  "body": "Hi all.\nJust a minor bug report (if it is a **bug** and not a **feature**).\n\nI set my **ART Preferences > General > Layout > Editor layout**\nto\n**Multiple Editor Tabs Mode**.\n\nIn this condition, if I'm correct, **NO Filmstrip** could be seen (you need to be in _Single Editor Tabs Mode_ to get this behaviour).\nAnyway, even if you are in **Multiple Editor Tabs Mode**like me  it is still possible to check and leave checked the option **Show Filmstrip Toolbar**, while - IMHO - this option should be dimmed in this situation\n\nThe  image below explains what I have found.\n\n<img width=\"936\" height=\"736\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acab25a7-9a9d-4c55-babb-b56e2908d0ca\" />\n\nKindly regards,\nTopoldo",
